#: src/prefs.js:130
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: src/prefs.js:131
msgid "Connect to Claude Code"
msgstr "连接到 Claude Code"

#: src/prefs.js:132
msgid ""
"When Claude is done or asks you something, you get a notification and its "
"turned off screen lights up. No account needed."
msgstr ""
"Claude 完成或向你提问时，你会收到通知，它所在的关闭屏幕会亮起。无需账号。"

#: src/prefs.js:137
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "已连接"

#: src/prefs.js:137
