msgstr "断开"

#: src/prefs.js:138
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "连接"

#: src/prefs.js:149
#, javascript-format
msgid "Could not change %s: %s"
msgstr "无法修改 %s：%s"

#: src/prefs.js:154
msgid "When Claude is done"
msgstr "Claude 完成时"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "When Claude waits for you"
msgstr "Claude 等你时"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "A permission or a question"
msgstr "权限请求或问题"

#: src/prefs.js:156
msgid "Also a notification"
msgstr "同时显示通知"

#: src/prefs.js:156
msgid "Click it to go to the terminal"
msgstr "点击转到终端"

#: src/prefs.js:157
msgid "Other programs too"
msgstr "其他程序也一样"

#: src/prefs.js:158
msgid ""
"Terminal bell or an app asking for attention, e.g. make ; printf \"\\a\""
msgstr "终端响铃或请求注意的应用，例如 make ; printf \"\\a\""

#: src/prefs.js:163
msgid "Sliders"
msgstr "滑块"

#: src/prefs.js:164
msgid ""
"Every monitor gets its own slider in Quick Settings, next to the volume "
"slider."
msgstr "每台显示器都会在快速设置中、音量滑块旁获得自己的滑块。"

#: src/prefs.js:166
msgid "Monitor menu"
msgstr "显示器菜单"

#: src/prefs.js:167
msgid "Simple (recommended)"
msgstr "简洁（推荐）"

#: src/prefs.js:168
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "详细"

#: src/prefs.js:169
msgid ""
"Simple: one slider for the value you pick. Detailed: a slider for every "
"value."
msgstr "简洁：为所选的值提供一个滑块。详细：每个值都有滑块。"

#: src/prefs.js:170
msgid "Left of the slider"
msgstr "滑块左侧"

#: src/prefs.js:171
msgid "Brightness icon"
msgstr "亮度图标"

#: src/prefs.js:172
msgid "Monitor number (1, 2, 3…)"
msgstr "显示器编号（1、2、3…）"

#: src/prefs.js:173
msgid "Short name (LG, VS…)"
msgstr "简称（LG、VS…）"

#: src/prefs.js:175
msgid "Show the monitor name on hover"
msgstr "悬停时显示显示器名称"

#: src/prefs.js:176
msgid "Replace GNOME’s own brightness slider"
msgstr "替换 GNOME 自带的亮度滑块"

#: src/prefs.js:177
msgid "The laptop screen then gets a row like the other monitors"
msgstr "笔记本屏幕也会像其他显示器一样拥有一行"

#: src/prefs.js:180
msgid "Night Light"
msgstr "夜灯"

#: src/prefs.js:181
msgid "Add a menu to the Night Light button"
msgstr "为夜灯按钮添加菜单"

#: src/prefs.js:182
msgid "Temperature, red screen and its strength"
msgstr "色温、红屏及其强度"

#: src/prefs.js:188
msgid "Evening"
msgstr "傍晚"

#: src/prefs.js:191 src/lib/ui.js:1293
msgid "Automatic dimming"
msgstr "自动调暗"

#: src/prefs.js:192
msgid ""
"Turn it on per monitor with the moon button next to its slider. The monitor "
"slowly gets darker and warmer in the evening and comes back in the morning."
msgstr ""
"在每个显示器滑块旁的月亮按钮中开启。显示器会在傍晚慢慢变暗变暖，早上恢复。"

#: src/prefs.js:194 src/lib/ui.js:1311
msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

#: src/prefs.js:195
msgid "At sunset"
msgstr "日落时"

#: src/prefs.js:196
msgid "At a fixed time"
msgstr "固定时间"

#: src/prefs.js:198
msgid "Morning transition"
msgstr "早晨过渡"

#: src/prefs.js:198
msgid "Minutes"
msgstr "分钟"

#: src/prefs.js:199 src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Morning"
msgstr "早晨"

#: src/prefs.js:199
msgid "Minutes after sunrise"
msgstr "日出后分钟数"

#: src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Brightness comes back at"
msgstr "亮度恢复时间"

#: src/prefs.js:206
msgid "For new monitors"
msgstr "新显示器的默认值"

#: src/prefs.js:207
msgid ""
"For the main monitor. The others take 30 minutes longer and go down to 0 %, "
"with a little extra dimming late at night. Each monitor can change these in "
"its own menu."
msgstr ""
"用于主显示器。其他显示器多 30 分钟，降到 0 %，深夜还会稍加额外调暗。每个显示"
"器都可以在自己的菜单中更改。"

#: src/prefs.js:209
msgid "Minutes after sunset"
msgstr "日落后分钟数"

#: src/prefs.js:210
msgid "Start time"
msgstr "开始时间"

#: src/prefs.js:213 src/lib/ui.js:1316
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "时长"

#: src/prefs.js:213
msgid "Minutes the evening dimming takes"
msgstr "傍晚调暗持续的分钟数"

#: src/prefs.js:215 src/lib/ui.js:37
msgid "Night brightness"
msgstr "夜间亮度"

#: src/prefs.js:215
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "百分比"

#: src/prefs.js:224 src/prefs.js:227
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: src/prefs.js:225
msgid ""
"Only used to calculate sunset and sunrise. Automatic uses the location GNOME "
"keeps for Night Light, otherwise your time zone. Nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"仅用于计算日落和日出。自动：使用 GNOME 为夜灯保存的位置，否则使用时区。不会发"
"送任何数据。"

#: src/prefs.js:228
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

#: src/prefs.js:229
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

#: src/prefs.js:231
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "纬度"

#: src/prefs.js:232
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "经度"

#: src/prefs.js:235
msgid "Today"
msgstr "今天"

#: src/prefs.js:252
msgid "manual"
msgstr "手动"

#: src/prefs.js:253
msgid "GNOME location"
msgstr "GNOME 位置"

#: src/prefs.js:254
#, javascript-format
msgid "time zone %s"
msgstr "时区 %s"

#: src/prefs.js:255
msgid "UTC offset"
msgstr "UTC 偏移"

#: src/prefs.js:258
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s · sunrise %s · from %s"
msgstr "日落 %s · 日出 %s · 来自 %s"

#: src/prefs.js:266
msgid "Screen off"
msgstr "关闭屏幕"

#: src/prefs.js:269
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "按钮"

#: src/prefs.js:270
msgid "In each monitor’s menu (the moon button)."
msgstr "在每个显示器的菜单中（月亮按钮）。"

#: src/prefs.js:272
msgid "Place"
msgstr "位置"

#: src/prefs.js:273
msgid "At the bottom, large"
msgstr "底部，大"

#: src/prefs.js:274
msgid "At the top, large"
msgstr "顶部，大"

#: src/prefs.js:275
msgid "Next to the monitor name, small"
msgstr "显示器名称旁，小"

#: src/prefs.js:277 src/lib/ui.js:340 src/lib/ui.js:1626 src/lib/ui.js:1697
msgid "Lowest light"
msgstr "最低亮度"

#: src/prefs.js:278
msgid "Brightness 0 and full extra dimming; press again to go back"
msgstr "亮度 0 并完全额外调暗；再按一次恢复"

#: src/prefs.js:279 src/prefs.js:285 src/lib/offmenu.js:48 src/lib/ui.js:341
#: src/lib/ui.js:1629
msgid "Turn off screen"
msgstr "关闭屏幕"

#: src/prefs.js:280 src/lib/offmenu.js:49 src/lib/ui.js:342 src/lib/ui.js:1640
msgid "Turn off other screens"
msgstr "关闭其他屏幕"

#: src/prefs.js:281
msgid "Press again to turn them back on"
msgstr "再按一次重新打开"

#: src/prefs.js:286
msgid "“Turn off screen” and “Turn off other screens” in each monitor’s menu."
msgstr "每个显示器菜单中的“关闭屏幕”和“关闭其他屏幕”。"

#: src/prefs.js:288
msgid "Light up while the mouse is on it"
msgstr "鼠标在上面时亮起"

#: src/prefs.js:289
msgid ""
"A turned off screen lights up while the mouse is on it and goes dark again "
"when the mouse leaves. The same button turns it back on."
msgstr ""
"关闭的屏幕在鼠标停在上面时亮起，鼠标离开后再次变暗。同一个按钮可以重新打开"
"它。"

#: src/prefs.js:294
msgid "A turned off screen"
msgstr "关闭的屏幕"

#: src/prefs.js:295
msgid ""
"Clicks and typing always reach the apps on it. Its options are in the "
"monitor’s menu (the moon button) and behind the small dot."
msgstr ""
"点击和输入始终会到达其上的应用。它的选项在显示器菜单（月亮按钮）和小圆点里。"

#: src/prefs.js:297
msgid "Small dot in a corner"
msgstr "角落的小圆点"

#: src/prefs.js:298
msgid "Click it for the screen’s menu; drag it to another corner"
msgstr "点击：屏幕菜单；拖动：移到另一个角"

#: src/prefs.js:299
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

#: src/prefs.js:300
msgid "The menu of the screen under the mouse"
msgstr "鼠标所在屏幕的菜单"

#: src/prefs.js:301
msgid "“Keep lit” lasts"
msgstr "“保持亮起”时长"

#: src/prefs.js:301
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#: src/prefs.js:305 src/lib/ui.js:1842 src/lib/ui.js:1917
msgid "Red screen"
msgstr "红屏"

#: src/prefs.js:306
msgid ""
"Switch it on in the Night Light menu. It removes all blue and green light, "
"which helps you fall asleep."
msgstr "在夜灯菜单中开启。去除所有蓝光和绿光，帮助入睡。"

#: src/prefs.js:308
msgid "Only while Night Light is active"
msgstr "仅在夜灯生效时"

#: src/prefs.js:309
msgid "Starts and stops together with Night Light"
msgstr "与夜灯一起开始和结束"

#: src/prefs.js:310 src/lib/ui.js:1858
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "强度"

#: src/prefs.js:324
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: src/prefs.js:328
msgid ""
"External monitors are controlled over DDC/CI. Your user needs access to /dev/"
"i2c-* (usually the “i2c” group)."
msgstr ""
"外接显示器通过 DDC/CI 控制。用户需要能访问 /dev/i2c-*（通常是“i2c”组）。"

#: src/prefs.js:332
msgid "ddcutil found"
msgstr "已找到 ddcutil"

#: src/prefs.js:332
msgid "ddcutil not found"
msgstr "未找到 ddcutil"

#: src/prefs.js:333
msgid "Install ddcutil from your distribution, then press Scan again"
msgstr "请从发行版安装 ddcutil，然后点击“重新扫描”"

#: src/prefs.js:335
msgid "Scan again"
msgstr "重新扫描"

#: src/prefs.js:340
msgid "ddcutil program"
msgstr "ddcutil 程序"

#: src/prefs.js:343
msgid "Extra arguments"
msgstr "额外参数"

#: src/prefs.js:346
msgid "Pause between writes"
msgstr "写入间隔"

#: src/prefs.js:347
msgid "Milliseconds. Raise it if a monitor misses changes"
msgstr "毫秒。如果显示器漏掉变化请调高"

#: src/prefs.js:351
