msgstr "%d 小时"

#: src/lib/ui.js:284
msgid "Earlier"
msgstr "提前"

#: src/lib/ui.js:287
msgid "Later"
msgstr "推后"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1086
msgid "Automatic dimming and more"
msgstr "自动调暗及更多"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1255
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1299
msgid ""
"Slowly dims this monitor in the evening, and brings it back in the morning."
msgstr "傍晚慢慢调暗这台显示器，早上恢复原样。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1300
msgid ""
"Drag the points to shape the evening; the big point also sets how long it "
"takes. + adds a button that runs by itself."
msgstr "拖动这些点来塑造夜晚；大点同时决定持续多久。+ 可添加自动运行的按钮。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1317
msgid "Shorter"
msgstr "更短"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1318
msgid "Longer"
msgstr "更长"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1328
msgid "Back to normal in the morning"
msgstr "早上恢复正常"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1332
msgid ""
"When the morning comes, lowest light and turned off screens go back to "
"normal, whether they were switched on by hand or by the graph."
msgstr "早上，最低亮度和关闭的屏幕会恢复正常，无论是手动还是由图表开启的。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1365
msgid "Back to 100 %"
msgstr "恢复为 100 %"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1368 src/lib/ui.js:1370
msgid "Back to the default evening curve"
msgstr "恢复默认的夜晚曲线"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1386
msgid "Back to the default: ×1 and GNOME’s automatic time (sunset)"
msgstr "恢复默认：×1 和 GNOME 的自动时间（日落）"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1391
msgid "Back to ×1"
msgstr "恢复为 ×1"

