#: src/lib/ui.js:1588
msgid ""
"While the screen is off, the monitor stays at its lowest light and this much "
"black is added on top. 25 % = a little darker, 100 % = fully black."
msgstr ""
"屏幕关闭时，显示器保持最低亮度，并在上面叠加这么多黑色。25 % = 稍暗一些，100 "
"% = 全黑。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1608
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit for %s"
msgstr "保持亮起 %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1609
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"On: after the mouse leaves, the screen stays lit for %s, then goes dark. "
"Off: it goes dark as soon as the mouse leaves."
msgstr "开：鼠标离开后，屏幕再亮 %s，然后变暗。关：鼠标一离开就变暗。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1693
#, javascript-format
msgid "Brightness %s"
msgstr "亮度 %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1695
msgid "Turned off"
msgstr "已关闭"

